 begin="3:18.056" end="3:19.091">要</span><span begin="3:19.091" end="3:19.509">刻</span><span begin="3:19.509" end="3:19.853">意</span><span begin="3:19.853" end="3:21.350">说</span></p><p begin="3:22.366" end="3:26.168" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.366" end="3:23.509">你</span><span begin="3:24.160" end="3:24.526">还</span><span begin="3:24.526" end="3:25.278">爱</span><span begin="3:25.278" end="3:26.168">我</span></p><p begin="3:28.177" end="3:33.159" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.177" end="3:29.243">当</span><span begin="3:29.243" end="3:29.642">看</span><span begin="3:29.642" end="3:30.303">尽</span><span begin="3:30.303" end="3:31.032">潮</span><span begin="3:31.032" end="3:31.768">起</span><span begin="3:31.768" end="3:32.542">潮</span><span begin="3:32.542" end="3:33.159">落</span></p><p begin="3:33.586" end="3:38.437" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.586" end="3:34.052">只</span><span begin="3:34.052" end="3:35.451">要</span><span begin="3:35.451" end="3:36.461">你</span><span begin="3:36.461" end="3:37.193">记得</span><span begin="3:37.193" end="3:38.437">我</span></p></div><div begin="3:39.713" end="3:50.393" itunes:songPart="Outro"><p begin="3:39.713" end="3:44.728" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.713" end="3:40.858">如</span><span begin="3:40.858" end="3:41.211">果</span><span begin="3:41.211" end="3:41.868">你</span><span begin="3:41.868" end="3:42.614">会</span><span begin="3:42.614" end="3:44.145">梦见</span><span begin="3:44.145" end="3:44.728">我</span></p><p begin="3:45.126" end="3:50.393" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:45.126" end="3:45.599">请</span><span begin="3:45.599" end="3:46.924">你</span><span begin="3:46.924" end="3:48.030">再</span><span begin="3:48.030" end="3:48.748">抱紧</span><span begin="3:48.748" end="3:50.393">我</span></p></div></body></tt>